   "widgets_values": [
    "# ComfyUI Studio — compatibility/optimization notes\nWD14 tagging is supplementary and does not modify the Qwen captions or generated output. For character detection, inspect the WD14 tags. High-confidence matches can be applied manually, or integrated programmatically into ComfyUI Studio later. This graph intentionally retains original model files, sampler settings, and FreeOllamaVRAM hooks. Qwen captioner still requires separate debugging for the earlier HTTP 400 error; localhost URL is already set correctly."
