   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# MODEL FAMILY: KREA 2\n\n**Compatible model examples / model location:**\nTurbo: finepornV5TurboNSFW_v5_int8_convrot.safetensors | RAW: snofsSexNudesAndOther_krea2RawV14_int8_convrot.safetensors\n\n**Important:** Select a Krea 2 diffusion/DiT file in UNETLoader, qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors in CLIPLoader with type krea2, and qwen_image_vae.safetensors in VAELoader. The Qwen3-VL name here is the required Krea text encoder, NOT a Qwen Image diffusion checkpoint.\n\n**Ollama caption model vs image model:** In `Qwen3VLAbliteratedPromptPair`, `huihui_ai/qwen3-vl-abliterated:8b-instruct` is an **Ollama image-analysis model**, not your generation checkpoint.\n\n**ComfyUI limitation:** Standard dropdowns still list all matching file types from shared folders; this note and labeled loader indicate what is appropriate, but do not restrict dropdown contents."
   ],
